# Build artifacts
*.asc
*.log
*.rpt
*.dfu
pico-ice/pico-ice.json
pico-ice/pico-ice.bin

# Archived reports of the released builds: only the timing reports are kept.
# The netlist and placed design are large intermediates, and the synthesis log
# records local install paths.
pico-ice/eu/*
pico-ice/na/*
!pico-ice/eu/pico-ice.rpt
!pico-ice/na/pico-ice.rpt

# Released bitstreams under bitstreams/ are committed on purpose, so that people
# without the toolchain can flash the board -- see docs/adr.md ADR-017.
# The line above ignores only the transient Makefile output.

# Python
__pycache__/

# Scratch space for temporary files and one-offs.
# The directory itself is kept so the convention is discoverable; its contents
# are never committed.
tmp/*
!tmp/.gitkeep
